#: hivepress-vendor-analytics.php:746
msgid "On the first of each month, vendors can be sent a summary of the month just gone, with a button that opens their full report. Switching it on sends to every vendor; the second setting hands each vendor the choice for themselves. Edit the wording under HivePress > Emails."
