msgid "Vendor choice"
msgstr ""

#: hivepress-vendor-analytics.php:761
msgid "Let vendors decide whether to receive them"
msgstr ""

#: hivepress-vendor-analytics.php:762
msgid "Adds the choice to each vendor's own settings page, so they can turn the email off. Switch this off to keep the decision yourself: vendors then see nothing about it and everyone is emailed. Any choices vendors have already made are remembered and come back if you switch this on again."
msgstr ""

