#: hivepress-vendor-analytics.php:4704
msgid "Quiet months"
msgstr ""

#: hivepress-vendor-analytics.php:770
msgid "Include vendors with no activity to report"
msgstr ""

#: hivepress-vendor-analytics.php:771
msgid "A month with no views, messages, bookings or earnings produces a page of zeros, so this is off by default. While vendors can decide for themselves, each one can override this on their own settings page."
msgstr ""

