msgid "Data"
msgstr ""

#: hivepress-vendor-analytics.php:781
msgid "Figures are stored as daily totals in two small database tables on your own site."
msgstr ""

#: hivepress-vendor-analytics.php:786
msgid "Retention (days)"
msgstr ""

#: hivepress-vendor-analytics.php:787
msgid "Daily aggregates older than this are deleted by a daily cron job. Set to 0 to keep data forever."
msgstr ""

#: hivepress-vendor-analytics.php:798
msgid "Removing the plugin"
msgstr ""

#: hivepress-vendor-analytics.php:799
msgid "What happens if you ever delete this plugin. WordPress always shows a \"will also delete its data\" warning on the delete screen, but unless the box below is ticked your analytics and settings are kept, so you can reinstall later and carry on where you left off. Deactivating never removes anything."
msgstr ""

#: hivepress-vendor-analytics.php:804
msgid "Delete all data"
msgstr ""

#: hivepress-vendor-analytics.php:805
msgid "Permanently delete all analytics data when this plugin is deleted"
msgstr ""

#: hivepress-vendor-analytics.php:806
msgid "Removes the two analytics tables, every setting on this tab and the internal order and booking markers. This cannot be undone."
msgstr ""

